    "provinceDeepAtlasProfile": {
      "oneLine": "Marrowynd is centered at 61.785677, -112.285013 under Representative Democracy, with 43,221,000 people across 11 settlements.",
      "extremeAtlasDescription": "Marrowynd occupies 6,188,436.06 sq mi / 16,027,975.82 sq km of modeled Earth-sized territory, about 3.142334% of Belavadös's surface. It is not merely a province but a continent-scale civic machine: Partial forest, Beach and grass with water and Farming define its broad terrain, while its settlements intensify into Beach and grass with water, Ocean Surface floating settlement, Partial forest and Farming. Population density is 2.697 people/sq km / 6.984 people/sq mi, which lets wilderness, roads, faction-held corridors, and vast uncrowded borders remain huge.",
      "peopleFactionsAndFaith": "The strongest public people-groups are Humans, Near-Humans, and Mixed Heritage, Halfling and Smallfolk, Animalfolk and Mammalian Anthropomorphs, Elf Parent Race and Elf Bloodlines, Amphibious and Aquatic Peoples, Fey and Trickster Folk, and 2 more. Frequently recorded peoples include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Harengon, Elf — Wood Elf, Elf — Eladrin, Fey-Folk — Faerie, Satyr, Changeling, and 4 more. Faction visibility leans toward The Nefaric Veil, with worship and patronage records naming Nebyrr, Ishtanora, Iskareth, Nefarokir, Eirzunet, Sigrananna, Thalunesh, and 3 more.",
      "groupLinkDescription": "The province participates in 19 recorded four-province geography group links, including 17 cross-transportation-group links. These links place it inside overlapping regional corridors rather than one isolated block, allowing border-adjacent transit, faction influence, and cultural spillover to breathe across group lines.",
